---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'About';
const description = 'About Taylor Designs.';
const permalink = `${Astro.site.href}about`;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} permalink={permalink} current="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Taylor Designs</h1>
    <figure class="about-image">
      <img src="/assets/Branding-Examples.png" alt="Logos I designed for CUE and LGBTQIAmes" width="330">
      <figcaption>
        Logos I designed for CUE and LGBTQIAmes
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>Hello! My name is Arthur and I'm an aspiring graphic designer who is extremely interested in logo and brand design!</p>
    <p>I have designed brands for multiple different purposes including my own brand. The other brands I've designed for are the Coalition for University Equity (CUE) and LGBTQIAmes, both are local groups based in the Ames aria. For each of them I did a full design package including logos, colors, font selection, pattern design, and a full brand manual for them to reference as needed.</p>
    <p>If you decide to work with me, you can expect a fully personalized experience with frequent updates and communication. I can design from scratch or help with rebranding. If you don't require a full brand package, you can still pick from a wide range of services including individual branding assets like a logo or pattern design. All available options and their prices can be found on the "Services" page.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-image {
    float: right;
    margin: -3em -7em 2em 2em;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  .about-image img {
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .about-image {
      float: none;
      margin: 0 auto 2em;
    }
  }
</style>
